{{Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva sidebar}}
This is a list of international presidential trips made by [[Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva|Lula da Silva]], the [[President of Brazil#Office-holders|39th]] and current president of [[Brazil]]. Lula has made 42 international trips to 43 countries during [[Second presidency of Lula da Silva|his second presidency]] so far, which began on 1 January 2023.

==First presidency (2003–2011)==
Number of visits per country during [[First presidency of Lula da Silva|Lula's first presidency]]:
* '''One:''' [[Algeria]], [[Comandante Ferraz Antarctic Station|Antarctica]], [[Austria]], [[Botswana]], [[Burkina Faso]], [[Cameroon]], [[Democratic Republic of the Congo|Congo]], [[Costa Rica]], [[Czech Republic]], [[Dominican Republic]], [[East Timor]], [[Egypt]], [[Equatorial Guinea]], [[Finland]], [[Gabon]], [[Guinea-Bissau]], [[Honduras]], [[Indonesia]], [[Iran]], [[Israel]], [[Jamaica]], [[Jordan]], [[Kazakhstan]], [[Kenya]], [[Lebanon]], [[Namibia]], [[Netherlands]], [[Nicaragua]], [[Norway]], [[Palestine]], [[Panama]], [[Senegal]], [[Syria]], [[Saudi Arabia]], [[Suriname]], [[Tanzania]], [[Trinidad and Tobago]], [[Turkey]], [[United Arab Emirates]], [[Vietnam]] and [[Zambia]]
* '''Two:''' [[Angola]], [[Belgium]], [[Cape Verde]], [[Ghana]], [[Japan]], [[Libya]], [[Nigeria]], [[Qatar]], [[São Tomé and Príncipe]], [[South Korea]], [[Sweden]], [[Ukraine]] and [[Vatican City|Vatican]]
* '''Three:''' [[China]], [[Denmark]], [[Germany]], [[Guatemala]], [[Guyana]], [[Haiti]], [[India]] and [[Mozambique]]
* '''Four:''' [[Cuba]], [[El Salvador]], [[Russia]], [[South Africa]]
* '''Five:''' [[Ecuador]] and [[Mexico]]
* '''Six:''' [[Colombia]], [[Italy]], [[Portugal]], [[Spain]] and [[United Kingdom]]
* '''Seven:''' [[France]], [[Peru]] and [[Switzerland]]
* '''Eight:''' [[Bolivia]], [[Chile]] and [[Paraguay]]
* '''Nine:''' [[Uruguay]]
* '''Twelve:''' [[United States]]
* '''Thirteen:''' [[Venezuela]]
* '''Eighteen:''' [[Argentina]]

[[File:List of international presidential trips made by Lula Da Silva.png|left|thumb|600x600px|Map of international trips made by President Lula: ''(1st presidency)'']]{{Clear}}

